      "writtenOn": "2024-05-16T08:33:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Q: You already checked if the `base` is present in the frames on line 405, what are the other reasons why this method can fail ? (conetxt: I am looking at https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/collections/struct.BTreeSet.html#method.insert and I see no other failure reason).",
